003e\n\u003c!-- 原因 3 --\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"p-2 bg-[#14161B] border border-border-grid rounded-[2px]\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex justify-between text-[11px]\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"text-gray-300 flex items-center gap-1.5\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"text-gray-500\"\u003e03.\u003c/span\u003e换热机组排污截断阀误触常开\n                    \u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"text-gray-400 font-bold\"\u003e2.4%\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"w-full bg-[#1A1D24] h-1.5 rounded-[1px] mt-1.5 overflow-hidden\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"bg-gray-600 h-full w-[2.4%]\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"mt-2 text-[9.5px] font-mono text-gray-500 pt-1.5 border-t border-border-grid flex justify-between\"\u003e\n\u003cspan\u003e模型推理耗时: 1.42s (Edge-RT)\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan\u003e输入特征维度: [seq_len=512, feat=12]\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c!-- 右侧 6列：关联拓扑与定位推算 --\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"lg:col-span-6 p-2.5 bg-[#0C0E13] border border-border-grid rounded-[3px] flex flex-col justify-between\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex justify-between items-center mb-2 font-mono\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"text-[11px] font-bold text-gray-200 flex items-center gap-1.5\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[14px] text-primary\"\u003eschema\u003c/span\u003e\n                  关联拓扑与定位推算结果\n                \u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"text-real text-[10px]\"\u003e水力拓扑图对齐\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"space-y-1.5 font-mono text-[10.5px]\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex justify-between p-2 bg-[#14161B] border border-border-grid rounded-[2px]\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"text-gray-400\"\u003e拟合泄漏点坐标估计:\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"text-primary font-bold\"\u003e里程桩 K2+320 ± 45米\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex justify-between p-2 bg-[#14161B] border border-border-grid rounded-[2px]\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"text-gray-400\"\u003e估计微漏率流量:\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"text-urgent font-bold\"\u003e11.5 ~ 14.8 m³/h\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex justify-between p-2 bg-[#14161B] border border-border-grid rounded-[2px]\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"text-gray-400\"\u003e邻近关联波及节点:\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"text-gray-200\"\u003e东风热力中继泵站 #04, 汇水井 J-12\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex justify-between p-2 bg-[#14161B] border border-border-grid rounded-[2px]\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"text-gray-400\"\u003e环境热红外推演温升:\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"text-warning font-bold\"\u003e+3.2 ℃ (覆土层表征)\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"mt-2 p-2 bg-[#13161D] border border-border-grid rounded-[2px] font-mono text-[9.5px] text-gray-400\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"text-gray-500 block mb-0.5\"\u003e自研模型推理张量日志：\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"text-gray-300 font-mono\"\u003e\n                Tensor: [seq_len=512, feat_dim=12] -&gt; LatentRes(0.894) -&gt; AttentionPeak@node_42 -&gt; Confirmed.\n              \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c!-- 现场巡检排查与闭环核查建议清单 --\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"p-2.5 bg-[#0C0E13] border border-border-grid rounded-[3px]\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"text-[11px] font-bold font-mono text-gray-200 mb-2 flex items-center gap-1.5\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[14px] text-real\"\u003etask_alt\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan\u003e现场巡检排查与闭环核查建议清单 (闭环工单执行建议)\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-2 font-mono\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"p-2 bg-[#14161B] border border-urgent/30 rounded-[2px]\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-urgent font-bold text-[10.5px] mb-1\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[13px]\"\u003epriority_high\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan\u003e步骤 1: 即刻声学定位\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"text-[10px] text-gray-400 leading-relaxed\"\u003e\n                调度巡检班组携带手持式多点相关测漏仪，直奔里程桩 K2+300 至 K2+350 区段，核查路面暗井与积水。\n              \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"p-2 bg-[#14161B] border border-warning/30 rounded-[2px]\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-warning font-bold text-[10.5px] mb-1\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[13px]\"\u003eautorenew\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan\u003e步骤 2: 压差补水应急联锁\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"text-[10px] text-gray-400 leading-relaxed\"\u003e\n                通知城北热网集控室切入恒压补水备用泵组，限制回水降压幅度不得突破 0.35 MPa 安全阈值底线。\n              \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"p-2 bg-[#14161B] border border-[#00B4D8]/30 rounded-[2px]\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[#00B4D8] font-bold text-[10.5px] mb-1\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[13px]\"\u003efact_check\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan\u003e步骤 3: 4小时数据复验\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"text-[10px] text-gray-400 leading-relaxed\"\u003e\n                现场完成阀门加固或卡箍抢修后，在系统内执行二次瞬态残差复核，验证补水量曲线是否平稳归零。\n              \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/section\u003e\n\u003c!-- ==================== CHAPTER 4: 数据完整性与工业安全声明 ==================== --\u003e\n\u003csection class=\"scada-card\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scada-card-header\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scada-card-title\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"tag-box\" style=\"background:rgba(16,185,129,0.15);border-color:#10B981;color:#10B981;\"\u003e04\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan\u003e第四章：数据完整性与工业安全声明\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2 py-0.5 bg-[#121E19] border border-real/40 rounded-[2px] text-real text-[9.5px] font-mono font-bold\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[12px]\"\u003everified_user\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan\u003e合规有效认证\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"p-3 space-y-2.5 font-mono\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-2\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"p-2.5 bg-[#0C0E13] border border-border-grid rounded-[3px]\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"text-[9.5px] text-gray-500 block\"\u003e遥测采样覆盖率\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"text-[20px] font-bold text-real mt-0.5 leading-none\"\u003e99.82%\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"text-[9px] text-gray-500 block mt-1\"\u003e丢失包率 &lt; 0.18% (已重传完整)\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"p-2.5 bg-[#0C0E13] border border-border-grid rounded-[3px]\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"text-[9.5px] text-gray-500 block\"\u003e传感器时间同步校准\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"text-[20px] font-bold text-gray-100 mt-0.5 leading-none\"\u003eNTP ≤ 2ms\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"text-[9px] text-gray-500 block mt-1\"\u003e符合 GB/T 30370 工控规范\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"p-2.5 bg-[#0C0E13] border border-border-grid rounded-[3px]\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"text-[9.5px] text-gray-500 block\"\u003e不可篡改校验哈希\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"text-[13px] font-bold text-primary mt-1 leading-tight truncate\"\u003ee3b0c44298fc...a89c\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"text-[9px] text-real block mt-1\"\u003e区块链分布式存证就绪\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"p-2.5 bg-[#0C0E13] border border-border-grid rounded-[3px]\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"text-[9.5px] text-gray-500 block\"\u003e报告签名责任主体\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"text-[12.5px] font-bold text-gray-100 mt-0.5 leading-normal\"\u003e专家工号 07 (数字秘钥签署)\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"text-[9px] text-gray-500 block mt-1\"\u003e证书有效期至 2027-12-31\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"text-[10px] text-gray-500 leading-relaxed pt-1\"\u003e\n          * 声明：本报告所引用之所有时序遥测数据均提取自国家热力 SCADA 网关直采镜像库，无任何虚构插值或人工作假。分析模型符合工业控制系统安全三级评估准则。\n        \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/section\u003e\n\u003c!-- ==================== 底部归档流水与信息录入 ==================== --\u003e\n\u003csection class=\"scada-card\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scada-card-header\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scada-card-title\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] text-primary\"\u003earchive\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan\u003e归档信息录入与全流程操作审计流水\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-gray-500\"\u003e\n          归档库分区: /ARCHIVE/2026/Q4/HEATING_ANOMALY/\n        \u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"p-3\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-3 font-mono\"\u003e\n\u003c!-- 归档表单 --\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"lg:col-span-6 space-y-2\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003clabel class=\"block text-[10.5px] text-gray-300 mb-1 font-bold\"\u003e\n                归档研判处置备注 (可选填)：\n              \u003c/label\u003e\n\u003ctextarea class=\"w-full rounded-[3px] bg-[#0C0E13] border border-border-grid p-2 text-[11px] text-gray-200 placeholder-gray-600 focus:outline-none focus:border-primary focus:ring-1 focus:ring-primary\" placeholder=\"例：已指派城北二班现场加压核实，计划于 11-03 14:00 前完成泄漏点卡箍修复闭环。\" rows=\"3\"\u003e\u003c/textarea\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex items-center justify-between pt-1\"\u003e\n\u003clabel class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[10.5px] text-gray-300 cursor-pointer\"\u003e\n\u003cinput checked=\"\" class=\"rounded-[2px] bg-[#0C0E13] border-border-grid text-primary focus:ring-0\" type=\"checkbox\"/\u003e\n\u003cspan\u003e同步抄送集团安全生产部工单系统\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/label\u003e\n\u003cbutton class=\"scada-btn\" onclick=\"alert('备注已暂存至本地工单缓存！')\"\u003e\n                保存暂存备注\n              \u003c/button\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c!-- 审计日志流水 --\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"lg:col-span-6 p-2.5 bg-[#0C0E13] border border-border-grid rounded-[3px] flex flex-col justify-between\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"text-[10px] text-gray-400 font-bold mb-1.5 flex justify-between\"\u003e\n\u003cspan\u003e审计日志追溯流 (Audit Trail)\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"text-real\"\u003e实时记录中\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"space-y-1.5 text-[10px]\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"text-gray-500\"\u003e08:30:12\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#00B4D8]\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"text-gray-200 truncate\"\u003eSCADA 传感器数据流切片固化完成 (共 3,060 个时序包)\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"text-gray-500\"\u003e08:42:05\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-warning\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"text-gray-200 truncate\"\u003eAI 引擎 ThermalNet-Mini 完成微渗漏特征提取与因果推演\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"text-gray-500\"\u003e08:45:18\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-real\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"text-gray-200 truncate\"\u003e张工 (专家工号 07) 确认研判结论并生成报告 V1.0\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex items-center gap-2 opacity-50\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"text-gray-500\"\u003e--:--:--\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-gray-600\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"text-gray-400\"\u003e等待归档指令确认...\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"text-[9px] text-gray-600 pt-1 border-t border-border-grid\"\u003e\n              数字指纹哈希已同步写入审计节点：sha256:4f8e0...228a\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/section\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/main\u003e\n\u003cscript\u003e\n  // 实时工控时钟更新\n  function updateClock() {\n    const d = new Date();\n    const pad = n =\u003e String(n).padStart(2, '0');\n    const clockEl = document.getElementById('liveClock');\n    if (clockEl) {\n      clockEl.textContent = `${d.getFullYear()}-${pad(d.getMonth()+1)}-${pad(d.getDate())} ${pad(d.getHours())}:${pad(d.getMinutes())}:${pad(d.getSeconds())}`;\n    }\n  }\n  setInterval(updateClock, 1000);\n  updateClock();\n\u003c/script\u003e\n\u003c/body\u003e\u003c/html\u003e"
}
